      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.34,
      "end_seconds": 12.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.37,
      "end_seconds": 25.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.62,
      "text": "It's headaches for a while. I thought I'd wait, uh, but it hasn't gone. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.62,
      "end_seconds": 31.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.28,
      "end_seconds": 36.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I've had it for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.2,
      "end_seconds": 47.17,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.72,
      "end_seconds": 55.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "I'd say on and off it settles a little with painkillers"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.3,
      "end_seconds": 61.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "What about neck tightness, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.48,
      "end_seconds": 75.4,
      "duration_seconds": 12.92,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, about a month. There's occasional nausea as well. Ah, with occasional nausea, it feels mild to me. It's every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.46,
      "end_seconds": 82.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Alright, any jaw pain on chewing, head injury or seizures at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.3,
      "end_seconds": 92.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "No jaw pain on chewing, head injury or seizures, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.59,
      "end_seconds": 97.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.1,
      "end_seconds": 103.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "I haven't had fever or confusion, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.64,
      "end_seconds": 107.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.37,
      "end_seconds": 115.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.44,
      "end_seconds": 118.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.84,
      "end_seconds": 139.97,
      "duration_seconds": 15.13,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. My husband and I live above the shop. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.82,
      "end_seconds": 158.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "right, do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.1,
      "end_seconds": 167.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "not currently, um, but as a youngster diclofenac gave me swelling of my lips"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.56,
      "end_seconds": 185.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.03,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.32,
      "end_seconds": 190.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.76,
      "end_seconds": 211.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Right, tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.6,
      "end_seconds": 222.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "Hydrochlorothiazide, 12.5 milligrams, every morning for my pressure i'm on paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when it hurts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 223.7,
      "end_seconds": 234.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.81,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier. Respiratory rate 17, blood pressure 119 over 82, temp 36.8 degrees. Pulse is 79 beats a minute, saturation 98 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.29,
      "end_seconds": 235.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.01,
      "end_seconds": 239.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.48,
      "end_seconds": 243.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.14,
      "end_seconds": 261.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "power and reflexes are equal on both sides"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.83,
      "end_seconds": 301.47,
      "duration_seconds": 35.64,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me so, based on the history and the examination, I'd lean towards a headache disorder of uncertain type a secondary headache we should exclude is also on my list i'm going to order an MRI of the brain, for headaches with visual symptoms i'll request an eye pressure check, it'll help with headache with blurred vision note down each headache with the date, time and what you were doing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.98,
      "end_seconds": 307.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "a neurologist would be the right next step, I'll refer you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.66,
      "end_seconds": 309.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.73,
      "end_seconds": 322.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "Come back or go to emergency straight away if you get sudden worst-ever headache or weakness. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.2,
      "end_seconds": 328.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "let me think, no, that's all thanks a lot"
    },
    {
